<includeonly>{{#tag:div
|{{{fallback|{{{后备文字|Loading DUI…}}}}}}
|class=dui-widget
|data-dui={{{component|{{{组件|button}}}}}}
|data-dui-props={{{props|{{{参数|}}}}}}
|data-dui-assets={{{assets|{{{素材|}}}}}}
}}</includeonly><noinclude>
Inserts a [[DUI]] component. Set <code>component</code> to the component name, <code>props</code> to its JSON options, and <code>fallback</code> to the text shown before the script loads. Use <code>assets</code> to map bundled asset paths to wiki filenames for this widget.

<syntaxhighlight lang="wikitext" copy>
{{DUI
|component=button
|props={"label":"Open inventory","action":"open-inventory"}
|fallback=Open inventory
}}
</syntaxhighlight>

Use <code>{{!}}</code> for a literal pipe inside a parameter. The template also accepts <code>组件</code>, <code>参数</code>, <code>素材</code> and <code>后备文字</code>.
</noinclude>
